### Step 9.19: Subscription, licensing & module management models
- `subscription_plan`, `subscription`, `subscription_invoice`
- `module`, `module_subscription`, `license`
- Align plan metadata with `hms-frontend/subscription-plan.md` (tier code, billing cycle, limit policy, and add-on eligibility contracts)
- Support entitlement governance fields needed for plan-fit decisions:
  - threshold/limit metadata for users, facilities, storage, and module gates
  - add-on minimum-plan requirement mapping
  - upgrade/downgrade/proration state tracking with auditable timestamps
  - plan-fit status snapshot fields (healthy/approaching_limit/exceeded)

